BUC id them and try them on for 1 turn--the only non-cursed ring that
can significantly immediately harm you is polymorph, and it's very
unlikely to polymorph you if you only try it on for 1 turn. Levitation
(among others--e.g. protection, invisibility) will auto-id itself).

I would wish for either DSM or a magic marker, depending on my AC and
the weight situation. The marker will let you write tons of blessed ?
enchant armor (among other things) but you might only get part of the
value now if you don't know ?charging yet.  Once you get ?charging
you'll be able to recharge it for the rest of the value.



